msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mtal-admin.php:682
msgid "Half-space (ZWNJ)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mtal-admin.php:684
msgid "Treat half-space (ZWNJ) as a space"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mtal-admin.php:685
msgid "On: a keyword written with a space and the same words joined by a half-space are the same keyword, in your keywords and in the page text. You only need one version of each keyword. Turn it off for languages where a half-space and a space mean different things. A half-space at the edge of a word still stops a partial match."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mtal-admin.php:689
msgid "Keyword order"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mtal-admin.php:691
msgid "Smart link diversity order by keywords per link based on Mohsen Tavoosi tutorial"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mtal-admin.php:692
msgid "Read the tutorial"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mtal-admin.php:693
msgid "On (recommended): inside each record, the first link on a page goes to keyword 1 (the first line), the next link to the first keyword that has no link on this page yet, and so on up to keyword 20. When every keyword found on the page has a link, it starts again from keyword 1. This spreads your links over all the keywords of a record instead of always linking the same words. Off: the order of keywords does not matter. The first match in the text gets the link, within the limits."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mtal-admin.php:697
msgid "Long phrases at their limit"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mtal-admin.php:699
msgid "Unlock longer phrases after their page limit: let shorter phrases inside them get linked"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mtal-admin.php:700
msgid "Off (default): a longer keyword always keeps its place, even when it already reached its limit and gets no link there. A shorter keyword is never linked inside it. Example: \"buy automatic door\" reached its limit, so in the next \"buy automatic door\" the words \"automatic door\" are not linked either. On: once the longer keyword reached its limit, the shorter keyword inside it can be linked, within its own limits."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mtal-admin.php:704
msgid "Short phrase without a link"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mtal-admin.php:706
msgid "Link a shorter phrase inside a longer matched phrase if the shorter phrase has not been linked yet on this page"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-mtal-admin.php:707
msgid "Off (default): a shorter keyword gets a link only where it appears on its own. On: if a shorter keyword has no link anywhere on the page, it is linked once inside a longer keyword that did not get a link there (a link can never sit inside another link). After that one link the longer keyword keeps its place again."
msgstr ""

